==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|zecke}}, from {{inh|de|goh|cecho}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*tīk(k)ō}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*tīkkô}}, suffixed variant of {{m|gem-pro|*tīgô}}; compare {{cog|nl|teek}} and {{cog|en|tick}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈtsɛkə/}}
* {{hyph|de|Ze|cke}}
* {{audio|de|De-Zecke.ogg|Audio}}

